nCode logo referenced by the official README; use an appropriate light/dark variant without redrawing it.","来源核查","2026-10-18","verified","适用方向",false,[152,209,210],"dimensions","3D","世界模型","开发阶段",[214,215,216],"stages","需求规划","玩法与代码","测试验证","主题",[220,221,222,223,224],"tags","命令行工具","Multiple models","Plan / Build","开源","AGENTS.md","延伸阅读",[227,228],{"_63":231,"_26":198},{"_63":229,"_26":230},"V1 to V2 migration boundaries","https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/migrate-v1/","Source code",[233],{"_63":111,"_26":234},"https://opencode.ai/docs/","用途与特点","适合独立选择模型与服务来规划和修改游戏项目。应明确固定 V1 或 V2：V2 迁移指南记录了不兼容的插件与服务端 API、默认允许访问外部目录，以及接受 LSP 配置却不运行 LSP 或返回诊断等差异。按所选版本检查权限、MCP 集成和编译测试反馈；编辑器与玩法观察仍需要其他工具。","detail","资源类型","代理","分类","编程代理","summary","name","agents","agent",[257,258],[255,221,222,256,224],[252,253,254],[159,250,251],"3d","world","plan","code","test","CLI","Open source",{"_63":231,"_26":198},{"_63":229,"_26":230},{"_260":261},"documents",{"_75":262,"_36":263},[265,269,270,271,268,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,285,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,267,304,266,305,306,307,308,309,310,311,312,313,314,315,316,317,318,319,320,321,322],[264,265,266,267,268],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-research-notes","engine-operation-contracts","production-work-orders","studio-production-case-studies","native-operation-details","production-debugging-contracts","production-coverage-gaps","generative-tools-research","generative-api-boundaries","generation-delivery-contracts","asset-validation-contracts","asset-selection-feedback","visual-evidence-research","visual-feedback-mechanisms","game-development-evaluation","benchmark-reproducibility","gameplay-state-contracts","agent-interface-evidence","